.git
.claude
docs
!docs/guides
deploy
# The bulk of the design package (JSX, components, examples, goldens, the verify
# harness) is not needed in the image — but cmd/web now imports the designfs
# package, which //go:embed's the frozen view-layer artifacts into the binary, so
# those specific paths MUST stay in the build context or `go build ./cmd/web` fails
# with "no required module provides package .../design-system".
design-system
!design-system/designfs.go
!design-system/templates
!design-system/tokens
!design-system/fixtures
!design-system/verify/config.json
!design-system/verify/states.json
docs-site
prototypes
**/node_modules
*.md
!docs/guides/*.md
